    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LD_1LC1RA_0RB0LC_0LB0LD [SWinR 2; SCycL 2 0; SWin 2; SCycR 2; SWin 1] (StD, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
