    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LD_1LC1RB_0RA1LA_0RD0LC [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 3 0; SWin 4; SCycR 3; SWin 1] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

