    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StA, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LD_1LC1RB_0RC1LA_0RC0LC [SCycL 3 0; SWin 8; SCycR 3; SWin 3; SWinR 1] (StA, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
