  apply (fire_of_run_instr tm Cc true true l B0_1RB1LD_1RC0RB_0LC0LD_1LA1LD p j [] []);
    [exact Hst | reflexivity | reflexivity | exact (gso_1RB1LD_1RC0RB_0LC0LD_1LA1LD p j E)].
Qed.


(** An instruction firing in the EXIT chain is reached from the outer overflow
